WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.468
Dr. Dolittle was very tired.

2
00:00:03.469 --> 00:00:06.462
He slept and slept for many days.

3
00:00:06.463 --> 00:00:11.905
Chee-Chee made sure nobody bothered the doctor.

4
00:00:11.906 --> 00:00:16.785
A few days later, the monkeys held a celebration for the doctor.

5
00:00:16.786 --> 00:00:24.148
"My friends, brothers, and sisters, tonight we honor Dr. Dolittle," the chief monkey said.

6
00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:27.354
All the monkeys stood up and beat their chests.

7
00:00:27.355 --> 00:00:34.723
"This land is now yours!" the chief spread his arms.

8
00:00:34.724 --> 00:00:40.722
"Thank you, but I’m afraid I can’t stay," Dr. Dolittle said, embarrassed.

9
00:00:40.723 --> 00:00:43.566
The monkeys stared at the doctor.

10
00:00:43.567 --> 00:00:46.609
"Pardon me?" the chief asked.

11
00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:52.160
"We must return to Puddleby," he announced.

12
00:00:52.161 --> 00:00:54.889
The next day the monkeys held a meeting.

13
00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:58.592
"Why does the doctor have to leave?" the chief asked.

14
00:00:58.593 --> 00:01:03.302
"Dr. Dolittle owes money in Puddleby," explained Chee-Chee.

15
00:01:03.303 --> 00:01:08.215
"What is money?" the chief asked.

16
00:01:08.216 --> 00:01:10.710
Chee-Chee explained about money.

17
00:01:10.711 --> 00:01:14.509
"Then how can we help him?" the chief said.

18
00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:21.020
"Give him a rare animal they don’t have in zoos," Chee-Chee answered.

19
00:01:21.021 --> 00:01:26.157
"ZOOS? What are zoos?" the monkeys asked together.

20
00:01:26.158 --> 00:01:33.675
"Zoos are where humans keep animals in cages," Chee-Chee said sadly.

21
00:01:33.676 --> 00:01:40.526
"Why? That’s . . . that’s . . . cruel!" whispered the chief.

22
00:01:40.527 --> 00:01:46.237
"Humans pay money to see animals in cages," Chee-Chee continued.

23
00:01:46.238 --> 00:01:50.494
The monkeys were glad they lived freely in the jungle.

24
00:01:50.495 --> 00:01:57.905
"Don’t worry! Dr. Dolittle will take very good care of the animal," said Chee-Chee.

25
00:01:57.906 --> 00:02:02.580
The monkeys decided to give Dr. Dolittle a pushmi-pullyu.

26
00:02:02.581 --> 00:02:06.936
The pushmi-pullyu is the rarest animal in the world.

27
00:02:06.937 --> 00:02:10.134
It is almost impossible to catch them.

28
00:02:10.135 --> 00:02:14.583
But the monkeys knew how and set out to find one.

29
00:02:14.584 --> 00:02:18.722
After a while, they returned with a strange-looking animal.

30
00:02:18.723 --> 00:02:23.337
The pushmi-pullyu had a head at each end and no tail.

31
00:02:23.338 --> 00:02:26.324
On each head were sharp horns.

32
00:02:26.325 --> 00:02:31.320
"Let me go!" The pushmi-pullyu began to cry.

33
00:02:31.321 --> 00:02:36.522
The pushmi-pullyu was very shy and scared.

34
00:02:36.523 --> 00:02:41.911
"Are you sure you cannot stay with us, Dr. Dolittle?" the chief asked again.

35
00:02:41.912 --> 00:02:43.417
"I wish I could.

36
00:02:43.418 --> 00:02:46.957
But I must go home," the doctor said kindly.

37
00:02:46.958 --> 00:02:50.706
"Then we want to give you a gift," the chief said.

38
00:02:50.707 --> 00:02:52.718
"What in the world?"

39
00:02:52.719 --> 00:02:57.230
Dr. Dolittle gazed at the strange creature.

40
00:02:57.231 --> 00:03:03.129
"May I present the rarest animal in the world? The pushmi-pullyu!"

41
00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:07.527
Dr. Dolittle could not take his eyes off the pushmi-pullyu.

42
00:03:07.528 --> 00:03:10.088
"Stop staring at me!"

43
00:03:10.089 --> 00:03:13.342
The creature began crying again.

44
00:03:13.343 --> 00:03:15.244
"Oh, I am so sorry.

45
00:03:15.245 --> 00:03:19.971
I didn’t mean to be rude," Dr. Dolittle apologized.

46
00:03:19.972 --> 00:03:22.758
"Which head do I talk to?"

47
00:03:22.759 --> 00:03:25.418
"I listen," said the first head.

48
00:03:25.419 --> 00:03:29.420
"And I speak," said the second.

49
00:03:29.421 --> 00:03:32.606
Dr. Dolittle looked at the creature.

50
00:03:32.607 --> 00:03:38.649
"I’ll take him only if he wants to come," the kind doctor explained.

51
00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:44.708
"If I don’t like it in your world, will you send me back?" asked the pushmi-pullyu.

52
00:03:44.709 --> 00:03:48.252
"I promise," Dr. Dolittle replied.

53
00:03:48.253 --> 00:03:53.553
The pushmi-pullyu agreed to go to Puddleby.

54
00:03:53.554 --> 00:03:58.393
"This animal will make you lots of money," Chee-Chee said happily.

55
00:03:58.394 --> 00:04:03.758
"Money? I don’t want money," Dr. Dolittle replied.

56
00:04:03.759 --> 00:04:05.312
"We need money!

57
00:04:05.313 --> 00:04:11.432
You must buy a boat for that sailor, and what about food?" cried Dab-Dab.

58
00:04:11.433 --> 00:04:13.940
"Money," sighed Dr. Dolittle.

59
00:04:13.941 --> 00:04:18.066
"What a headache!"

60
00:04:18.067 --> 00:04:21.457
It was time to say good-bye to the monkeys.

61
00:04:21.458 --> 00:04:26.005
"We will never forget you, Dr. Dolittle," the chief monkey said.

62
00:04:26.006 --> 00:04:30.231
One by one, the monkeys came up to Dr. Dolittle.

63
00:04:30.232 --> 00:04:34.925
"Three cheers for Dr. Dolittle!" shouted the chief.

64
00:04:34.926 --> 00:04:42.525
With that, Dr. Dolittle left the Land of the Monkeys.

